  "description_en": "Performs a paged query to retrieve the publication information of a specified API product, which is a list of portal records to which the product is published. Each list item contains the publication record ID, portal ID, portal name, API product ID, API product name, and API product type. The results can be filtered by portal name and parameter query based on paging",
